ytic apps that can be<br>shared via the private cloud or the Alteryx Analytics Gallery public cloud</li>\n            <li>End markets: Automotive, commercial real estate, restaurants and entertainment, fast<br>moving consumer goods, retail franchising and telecommunications</li>\n            <li>Has 250+ customers and 200,000+ users worldwide</li>\n            <li>Founded in 1997</li>\n            <li>Headquartered in Irvine, CA</li>\n            <li class=\"subitem\">Also has offices in Boulder and Silicon Valley</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section management\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">Management</div>\n        <table class=\"management-table\">\n          <colgroup><col><col><col></colgroup>\n          <thead>\n            <tr>\n              <th>Name</th>\n              <th>Title</th>\n              <th>Affiliations/experience</th>\n            </tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Dean Stoecker</td>\n              <td>Chairman &amp; CEO</td>\n              <td>Integration Technologies, Donnelly<br>Marketing Information Services</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>George Mathew</td>\n              <td>President &amp; Chief<br>Operating Officer</td>\n              <td>SAP, salesforce.com, Fort Point<br>Partners</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Gary Acord</td>\n              <td>CFO</td>\n              <td>KPMG, KACE</td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section investors\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">Investors</div>\n        <div class=\"investor-logo\">SAP VENTURES</div>\n        <table class=\"funding-table\">\n          <tbody>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Total capital raised:</td>\n              <td>$6.0mm</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <td>Last round:</td>\n              <td>Series A