x data, insights and applications into other systems with<br>open API and SDK</li>\n                <li>Publishes and shares analytic applications with full control over access,<br>visibility and sharing</li>\n                <li>Enables scheduled, event-triggered and ad-hoc analysis to support<br>critical decisions across companies</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"product-row api\">\n            <div class=\"vertical-label\">API</div>\n            <div class=\"product-content\">\n              <ul class=\"square-list\">\n                <li>Provides consumerization of Big Data Analytics</li>\n              </ul>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section customers\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">Key customers</div>\n        <div class=\"customer-area\">\n          <div class=\"att-logo\">\n            <div class=\"att-globe\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n            at&amp;t\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"comcast-logo\">\n            c<span class=\"o\">o</span>mcast\n            <span class=\"spotlight\">SP<span class=\"o\">O</span>TLIGHT</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"newham-logo\">\n            Newham University Hospital <span class=\"nhs\">NHS</span>\n            <span class=\"trust\">NHS Trust</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"experian-logo\">\n            <span class=\"experian-mark\">\n              <b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b><b></b>\n            </span>Experian\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"teradata-logo\">Teradata</div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">14</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
